 Now we will plug in $-2$ into each of the polynomials of the form $(ax + b)^n$ as $(ax + b)^n = (a(-2) + b)^n = (2b - 2a)^n$ after plugging in \((-2)\) to $x$ and choosing the coefficients to plug in afterwards yields \[
(5x + 9)^{611} = (2\cdot 9 - 2\cdot 5)^{611} = (8)^{611}
\] \[
(x + 5)^{11} = (2\cdot 5 - 2\cdot 1)^{11} = (8)^{11}
\] \[
(x - 1)^{11} = (2\cdot 1 - 2\cdot 1)^{11} = 0
\] Since \[
(5x + 9)^{611} + (x + 5)^{11} + (x - 1)^{11} + 3x^2 + 1 = ((8)^{11} + (8)^{611} + 3x^2 + 1) \pmod{x + 2}
\] then \[
